{"id":"vod_bf_2717","vodId":"2717","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"笨女孩","name_cn":"笨女孩","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-3/bf9524e5262ca233f361bf691f7f97af.jpg"},"summary":"花畑佳子（悠木碧 配音）是一个实实在在的笨蛋。不仅学习力为零，常常收获零分的考卷，在生活中，也是个完全不认路，总是莫名其妙惹出各种各样麻烦的问题人物。可是，佳子虽然脑袋笨，却拥有一颗闪闪发光的善良的内心。阿久津明（杉田智和 配音）和佳子刚好相反，他拥有绝顶聪明的头脑，却不擅长一切和运动有关的事情。是他一直陪伴在佳子身边，照顾着她的学习和生活。　　温柔迷糊的隅野沙耶香（原田彩枫 配音）是佳子唯一的也是最好的朋友，她的言行举止常常在不知不觉之中被佳子带歪。风纪委员长（上坂堇 配音）苦苦的暗恋着津明，佳子对于她来说，是情敌一般的存在。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 22:48:32","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/bennvhai/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/bennvhai/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/bennvhai/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/bennvhai/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/bennvhai/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/bennvhai/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/bennvhai/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/bennvhai/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/bennvhai/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/bennvhai/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/bennvhai/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/bennvhai/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:32:07.795Z"}